			"notes": "# Backup MC world before Updating to this version!\n## 20.1.20 / 0.7.0 **(14/05/24)**\n- Eviscerated All Known Crashes\n- Removed Old Sky Colony\n- Removed Gigantic and Huge Volvox Features\n- Fixed Gravilite Debris Field Not Having any Crystals\n- Added Pillager Outposts To Eden Ring\n- Made Allays Turn Into vexes at night On Eden Ring\n\n## 20.1.19 / 0.7.0-beta.9 **(19/03/24)**\n- Fixed Some Things\n\n## 20.1.18 / 0.7.0-beta.8 **(LTS)**\n- Fixed Some Bugs\n\n## 20.1.17 / 0.7.0-beta.7 **(24/02/24)**\n- Fixed Incompatibility With FAPI >=0.92.0\n\n## 20.1.16 / 0.7.0-beta.8 **(Unreleased Beta)**\n- Fixed Some Bugs\n\n## 20.1.15 / 0.7.0-beta.5 **(23/02/24)**\n- De Bump Fabric API\n\nINCOMPATIBLE WITH FABRIC API 0.92.0!!!\n\n## 20.1.14 / 0.7.0-beta.4 **(16/02/24)**\n- Fix Old Sky Colony Not Generating\n- Added Gravilite Debris Fields\n- Bump Fabric API to 0.92.0\n- Bump BCLib to 3.0.14\n\n## 20.1.13 / 0.7.0-beta.3 **(14/02/24)**\n- Added Old Sky Colony\n- Reverted Biome Specific Music\n- Added Upcoming Items Into Registry\n\n**VISUAL BUGS HAVE BEEN FIXED IN 0.6.12**\n\n## 20.1.12 / 0.7.0-beta.2 **(11/02/24)**\n- Fixed Biome Tint Without Sodium (Villhume)\n- Fixed Translucent Player (Villhume)\n- Fixed GV For the third time (ErzeKawek)\n- Removed Sodium As A Dependency (ErzeKawek)\n- Fixed ModernFix Texture Baking Errors (Embeddedt)"
		},
